imens was met by 12 (63%) countries in 2011 and 13 (68%) countries in 2012. The geographic distribution of subnational AFP surveillance quality indicators varied among countries with PV circulation. In the African Region, ≥80% of the population lived in areas meeting both AFP surveillance quality indicators only in Nigeria in 2011, and in Angola, Central African Republic, Kenya, and Nigeria in 2012.","hasAlt":true,"isDecorative":false,"isMissingAlt":false,"ariaHidden":false,"rolePresentation":false,"renderedWidth":624,"renderedHeight":412,"naturalWidth":624,"naturalHeight":412,"loading":null,"decoding":null,"altVerdict":"TOO_LONG","altReason":"alt text is 884 characters — consider a caption or description","bytes":61790},{"src":"https://www.cdc.gov/TemplatePackage/images/icon_pdf.gif","alt":"Adobe PDF file","hasAlt":true,"isDecorative":false,"isMissingAlt":false,"ariaHidden":false,"rolePresentation":false,"renderedWidth":16,"renderedHeight":16,"naturalWidth":16,"naturalHeight":16,"loading":null,"decoding":null,"altVerdict":"GOOD","altReason":"present, no red flags","bytes":6058},{"src":"https://www.cdc.gov/TemplatePackage/images/icon_word.gif","alt":"Microsoft Word file","hasAlt":true,"isDecorative":false,"isMissingAlt":false,"ariaHidden":false,"rolePresentation":false,"renderedWidth":16,"renderedHeight":16,"naturalWidth":16,"naturalHeight":16,"loading":null,"decoding":null,"altVerdict":"GOOD","altReason":"present, no red flags","bytes":1087},{"src":"https://www.cdc.gov/TemplatePackage/images/icon_excel.gif","alt":"Microsoft Excel file","hasAlt":true,"isDecorative":false,"isMissingAlt":false,"ariaHidden":false,"rolePresentation":false,"renderedWidth":16,"renderedHeight":16,"naturalWidth":16,"naturalHeight":16,"loading":null,"decoding":null,"altVerdict":"GOOD","altReason":"present, no red flags","bytes":644},{"src":"https://www.cdc.gov/TemplatePackage/images/icon_ppt.gif","alt":"Microsoft PowerPoint file","hasAlt":true,"isDecorative":false,"isMissingAlt":false,"ariaH